Subject: Cantor Semantic Anchor Catalogue P0

Description: A generation-bound table-of-contents and operation-index projection that converts subject, purpose, and use-case signals into proof-carrying exact semantic-address candidates while preserving typed association channels and deterministic authority gates.

@ [source] C:\Project\Cantor\source_documents\2026-08-19_semantic_anchor_catalogue_p0\Dictated_Semantic_Anchor_Catalogue_P0_Source.sop
@ [source_manifest] C:\Project\Cantor\source_documents\2026-08-19_semantic_anchor_catalogue_p0\Source_Document_Manifest.sop
